# PMO Executive Dashboard — Google Sheets + Apps Script + Looker Studio

**Live Dashboard:** [PMO Dashboard](https://datastudio.google.com/s/hxHjHqEAJUo)

A lightweight Project Management Office (PMO) reporting pipeline that takes a raw project export, cleans and enriches it with schedule-performance metrics via Google Apps Script, and visualizes the results in a Looker Studio executive dashboard.

